{"id":512,"date":"2026-10-05T18:22:30","date_gmt":"2026-10-05T18:22:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/health\/hospital-specialist-treatments\/endocrinology-and-metabolic-diseases\/","raw":"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/health\/hospital-specialist-treatments\/endocrinology-and-metabolic-diseases\/"},"modified":"2026-10-05T18:22:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-05T18:22:30","password":"","slug":"endocrinology-and-metabolic-diseases","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/health\/hospital-specialist-treatments\/endocrinology-and-metabolic-diseases\/","title":{"raw":"Endocrinology and Metabolic Diseases","rendered":"Endocrinology and Metabolic Diseases"},"content":{"raw":"<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Hormones produced by the endocrine glands carry essential messages around the body, and when too much or too little is produced, a range of disorders can develop. The endocrine team at our partner hospital evaluates these conditions and, where surgery is needed, offers surgical treatment focused mainly on the thyroid, parathyroid and adrenal glands. MedLuxLife helps you gather your hormone tests and imaging and coordinates consultation and treatment planning.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":433,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dept-endocrinology-and-metabolism-diseases.jpg\" alt=\"Endocrinology and Metabolism Diseases - specialist hospital care\" class=\"wp-image-433\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatments and services<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Thyroid disorders<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Evaluation and treatment of thyroid conditions affecting metabolism, energy use and heat production, including surgical removal of all or part of the gland (thyroidectomy) where appropriate.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Parathyroid disorders<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Care for conditions of the four parathyroid glands that regulate calcium and phosphorus, including parathyroidectomy and parathyroid transplantation.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Adrenal disorders<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Assessment and treatment of adrenal gland conditions affecting cortisol, blood pressure-related hormones and development, including adrenalectomy.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pancreatic surgery<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pancreatectomy, the removal of part or all of the pancreas, for example for neuroendocrine tumours.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Careful surgical technique<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Endocrine operations are performed by surgeons with dedicated experience, with particular care taken to protect the voice and calcium balance and to minimise bleeding.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-columns\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-columns\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conditions treated<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Adrenal tumours<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cushing's syndrome<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Parathyroid gland disorders<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Parathyroid adenomas<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Parathyroid cancer<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hyperparathyroidism<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hyperthyroidism<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Goitre<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Graves' disease<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Toxic (hyperfunctioning) thyroid nodules<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Thyroid nodules<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Thyroid cancer<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Neuroendocrine tumours<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent laboratory results<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent hormone, calcium and metabolic blood test results<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Thyroid ultrasound or other endocrine imaging reports<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div cla